  hint: Found at the dovecote
  characterDescription: "Swan\r\nFound at the dovecote\r\nOutfit inspired by modern
    Avebury visitors\r\nSydney is very enthusiastic about her photography, and enjoys
    taking photos of the landscape and visitors at Avebury. She bought her first
    camera after learning about nature photography and deciding she wanted to give
    it a try. It turns out it\u2019s much easier to take photos of wildlife if you\u2019re
    friends with them.\r"
